OL,3,CFirst beaver births in four centuries
OL,4,Crecorded in Scottish Highlands
OL,6,FAt least two baby beavers have been
OL,7,Fborn in an area of the Scottish
OL,8,FHighlands, marking the first time in
OL,9,Ffour centuries that births have been
OL,10,Frecorded in the region.
OL,12,FThe beaver kits were born in the Glen
OL,13,FAffric area, around 15 miles from Loch
OL,14,FNess, following a joint re-
OL,15,Fintroduction project by Trees for Life
OL,16,Fand Forestry and Land Scotland (FLS).
OL,18,FThey were spotted at Loch Beinn a
OL,19,FMheadhoin in the glen, and are
OL,20,Freportedly in good health.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
