PN,31802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785336505
OL,3,CFirst beaver births in four centuries
OL,4,Crecorded in Scottish Highlands
OL,6,FExperts from Trees for Life and FLS
OL,7,Festimate the duo were born in either
OL,8,FMay or June.
OL,10,FTobias Leask, a beaver management
OL,11,Fofficer for Trees for Life, said:
OL,12,F"These beaver kits symbolise a
OL,13,Fwildlife success story four centuries
OL,14,Fin the making, and how nature can
OL,15,Frecover when we give it a chance.
OL,17,F"Seeing them for the first time is
OL,18,Fsomething I'll never forget. It was
OL,19,Fone of those rare moments when you
OL,20,Frealise you're witnessing history.
OL,26,@tD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
