PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785336505
OL,3,CFirst beaver births in four centuries
OL,4,Crecorded in Scottish Highlands
OL,6,F"These young animals represent the
OL,7,Ffirst generation of beavers that will
OL,8,Fhelp shape Glen Affric's future `
OL,9,Fcreating wetlands that support
OL,10,Fcountless other species, improve water
OL,11,Fquality and build resilience to
OL,12,Fclimate change.
OL,14,F"It's a wonderful milestone for
OL,15,Feveryone involved in the project."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUwD@bO]
