PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785336505
OL,3,CFirst beaver births in four centuries
OL,4,Crecorded in Scottish Highlands
OL,6,FThe births come after a family of five
OL,7,Fbeavers and a beaver pair were
OL,8,Freleased at the two sites in Glen
OL,9,FAffric National Nature Reserve in
OL,10,FOctober 2025, with another four
OL,11,Freleased in February.
OL,13,FDr Roisin Campbell-Palmer, head of
OL,14,Frestoration at Beaver Trust, said:
OL,15,F"The arrival of these kits is a very
OL,16,Fencouraging indication that the
OL,17,Fbeavers have settled well into their
OL,18,Fnew surroundings and are establishing
OL,19,Fthemselves as a healthy, breeding
OL,20,Fpopulation.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
