PN,31805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785336505
OL,3,CFirst beaver births in four centuries
OL,4,Crecorded in Scottish Highlands
OL,6,F"Every reintroduction requires careful
OL,7,Fplanning and close monitoring after
OL,8,Frelease, so it is hugely rewarding to
OL,9,Fsee the animals adapting so
OL,10,Fsuccessfully.
OL,12,F"This achievement reflects the
OL,13,Fcommitment and collaboration of
OL,14,Feveryone involved and provides further
OL,15,Fevidence that well-managed
OL,16,Ftranslocations can support the
OL,17,Fresponsible restoration of beavers
OL,18,Facross Scotland in line with the
OL,19,FScottish Government's National Beaver
OL,20,FStrategy."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU|D@JO]
