OL,3,CFirst beaver births in four centuries
OL,4,Crecorded in Scottish Highlands
OL,6,FEurasian beavers were previously
OL,7,Fhunted to extinction in Scotland at
OL,8,Fsome point in the 16th century, and
OL,9,Fwere reintroduced in 2009.
